        "subject": "Next Step: Technical Qualifying Questions — Sunny AI Operator Application",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.full_name || $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.applicant_name }},</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for applying for the <strong>AI Operator</strong> position at <strong>Sunny</strong>. Our evaluation team reviewed your submission, and your background and portfolio scored strongly in our initial screening.</p>\n\n<p>Because we value <em>tools that run and save the team time</em>, the next step in our process is answering a few tailored technical qualifying questions directly related to your experience:</p>\n\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>{{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.qualifying_questions[0] }}</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>{{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.qualifying_questions[1] }}</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>{{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.qualifying_questions[2] }}</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>{{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.qualifying_questions[3] }}</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>{{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.qualifying_questions[4] }}</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Please submit your detailed answers via our qualifying portal here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://marcneil.app.n8n.cloud/webhook-test/qualifying-response?email={{ $('Parse & Validate Evaluation.').item.json.email }}\"><strong>👉 Submit Your Qualifying Responses</strong></a></p>\n\n<p>We evaluate answers on technical depth, error handling, and operational problem-solving.</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<strong>Sunny Talent & Operations Team</strong></p>",
        "options": {}
